Subject: [PATCH v7 8/8] ext4: Optimize match for casefolded encrypted dirs
From:   Daniel Rosenberg <drosen@google.com>
To:     "Theodore Ts'o" <tytso@mit.edu>, linux-ext4@vger.kernel.org,
